    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHollymount is a superbly positioned three-bedroom semi-detached residence set on a generous site with a large south-facing rear garden. While the property requires extensive refurbishment and modernisation throughout, it offers exceptional potential for discerning purchasers seeking to create a bespoke family home or investment opportunity.\n\nThe property is being offered for sale together with the adjoining residence, Avalon (two separate sales), presenting a rare and highly attractive redevelopment prospect in one of Cork's most sought-after residential locations.\n\nIdeally situated on Hartlands Avenue, directly opposite The Lough Nature Reserve, the location is truly second to none. Rarely does a development opportunity arise to acquire a property in such a prime setting, with immediate access to a wealth of amenities including University College Cork (UCC), Bons Secours Hospital, Cork University Hospital (CUH), Cork city centre, and the extensive south ring road network. \n\nThis is a unique opportunity that should not be missed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.46m x 1.82m\nOriginal terrazzo floor. Under stairs storage press.\n\nLiving Room - 3.78m x 3.66m\nWell-proportioned reception room with an original fireplace with timber mantle and tiled insert. Original picture rails\n\nDining Room - 3.90m x 3.52m\nSunny south facing reception room with an original tiled open fireplace and picture rails.\n\nKitchen - 4.13m x 1.96m\nLocated to the rear enjoying the south aspect, the kitchen has direct access to the garden. There is an original terrazzo floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.29m x 3.40m\nGenerous double bedroom to the front featuring original tiled fireplace and original picture rails.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m x 3.38m\nSpacious double bedroom to the rear with an original tiled fireplace and original picture rails. Hotpress store.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.25m x 2.07m\nSingle bedroom to the front.\n\nBathroom - 2.03m x 1.89m\nThree-piece bath suite.\n\n"
      },
      {
